Research attribution, not code

The persona methodology of Mantoz is informed by MatrAIx-Persona-8B: the idea of
a large categorical persona schema, dependency-aware synthetic generation, and
evidence-aware human grounding.

  Paper:      arXiv:2608.04205  https://arxiv.org/abs/2608.04205
  Repository: https://github.com/MatrAIx-ai/MatrAIx-Persona-8B

No MatrAIx code and no MatrAIx dataset ships in this repository. The schema,
generator and grounding pipeline here are written from scratch. The published
Persona1M corpus carries a research-only license and is never used in a
production path.
